{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","暗影打击"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","闪现到敌方身边进行多段攻击。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","闪现到一名敌军身边，先对目标造成3次100% ATK伤害，之后短暂冻结目标并跳起再对目标造成150% + 20% ATK伤害，在此期间自身处于无敌状态，随后额外回复终极技能期间造成总伤害25%的生命值。优先选择最虚弱的敌军为目标。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":50,"end":56,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":46,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":71,"end":73,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"},{"start":105,"end":109,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","跳起时对目标造成的伤害提升至160% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每层“嗜血”使额外回复的生命值提升至总伤害的15%。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","跳起时对目标造成的伤害提升至170% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","跳起时对目标造成的伤害提升至180% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","弱肉强食"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","飞扑到附近最虚弱的敌人身边造成伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","飞扑至范围内最虚弱的敌军身边，对其造成150% + 15% ATK伤害，并附带目标已损失生命值25%的额外伤害，额外伤害最高不超过赛特斯400%的攻击力。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":10,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至160% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至170% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至180% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","猎手本能"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","敌人生命值过低时自身获得属性加成。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当场上召唤物以外的敌军生命值百分比首次低于33%时，赛特斯获得一层“嗜血”，永久提升10 + 1.5点急速与7 + 1点生命汲取，最多叠加3层。首次获得“嗜血”时赛特斯还会额外提高自身25%的护甲与魔抗。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":44,"end":50,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":55,"end":59,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","场上召唤物以外的敌军血量百分比首次低于50%时便可获得一层“嗜血”。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每层“嗜血”永久提升12 + 1.5点急速与10 + 1点生命汲取。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":24,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","首次获得“嗜血”时还会额外获得25点暴击。"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升12%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升16%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升20%。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","追猎狂欢"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","有敌人被击败时，“弱肉强食”立即冷却完毕，且回复一定能量。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每当一名召唤物以外的敌军被击败时，“弱肉强食”立即冷却完毕，并为自身恢复200点能量。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每次释放“弱肉强食”后，本场战斗内该技能造成的伤害额外提高15%，最多叠加5次。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","恢复能量提升至240点。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","恢复能量提升至260点。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","释放技能“弱肉强食”时若自身拥有“嗜血”效果，则会额外降低目标护甲。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","释放技能“弱肉强食”时若自身拥有“嗜血”效果，则每有1层“嗜血”会额外降低目标15%的护甲，持续6秒。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","迅牙"]]}